            "block_content": "Section 3. The following Articles of the Collective Bargaining Agreement shall not apply to PRN Nurses: Article 4; Articles 7 through 16; Article 17, Sections 3, 4 and 9 Articles 19 through 24; Article 25, Sections 1 thru 13; Article 29; Article 31; Article 40; Articles 42, -thru 44; and Article 46.",
