            "block_content": "Section 4. PRN Nurses who have at least one year of service since their most recent appointment with the Commonwealth on July 31, 2004; July 31, 2006; January 31, 2007 as appropriate and who transfer from PRN status to full-time status will be eligible to receive a one step service increment effective the first day of the first full pay period in July 2004; July 2006; and January 2007, as appropriate.",
